config BR2_PACKAGE_XDG_UTILS
	bool "xdg-utils"
	help
	  freedesktop.org desktop integration scripts: xdg-open,
	  xdg-mime, xdg-settings, xdg-email, xdg-screensaver,
	  xdg-desktop-menu, xdg-desktop-icon, xdg-icon-resource.
	  Opens files and URLs with the user's default applications
	  (mimeapps.list) from scripts and the command line.

	  https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-utils/
